Building infrastructure and land use, no machinery.
Location: Data for 1 producer
Technology: Infrastructure (land use and buildings) for the production of magnesium not including equipment.
Time period: Environmental report
Production volume: 105600 tonnes in 1998
Sampling: Estimation with map. 
Extrapolations: From 1 producer to average Europe
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c71a40a4-f2df-3dc8-b299-7e680c0287f1.xml</text>
